        tom: { text: '"Tom was a Fish-Man shipwright \u2014 the greatest there ever was. He built the Oro Jackson for Gol D. Roger. The Government let him live long enough to build this sea train, then took him to Enies Lobby anyway. His apprentices were Iceburg and a brat called Cutty Flam."', next: "a" }
