            text: `"A new challenger! The rules are simple: there are no rules! Your block is a battle royale \u2014 beat three gladiators and you reach the final against the Hero of the Colosseum himself, DIAMANTE! Your block's fighters are waiting in the arena outside. Good luck \u2014 you'll need it!"`,
