              if (active4(ctx, "nw_birdcage", "report")) return '"(The old gladiator lifts his iron helmet. Beneath it is the face of Riku Dold III, the king everyone swore was a monster.) The strings are gone. My people are free. And you... you did what I could not do in ten years."';
              return `"(An old man in an iron helmet nurses a cup of water.) Ten years ago the king of this country burned his own people's towns. Or so they say. Strings, stranger. Look for the strings. That is all an old gladiator will tell you."`;
